DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261207
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261208
SUMMARY:Court of the First Additional Sessions Judge: A revision petition b
 y the Banbhoolpura police against a Haldwani magistrate's order of 6 Octob
 er to register an FIR over Form 7s filed to delete 28 electors in the name
  of a booth level agent who says he did not file them
DESCRIPTION:A revision petition by the Banbhoolpura police against a Haldwa
 ni magistrate's order of 6 October to register an FIR over Form 7s filed t
 o delete 28 electors in the name of a booth level agent who says he did no
 t file them. On 30 October the court refused to stay the order. The revisi
 on petition is listed for hearing. Court: Court of the First Additional Se
 ssions Judge. Source: Dainik Jagran\, https://www.jagran.com/uttarakhand/n
 ainital-haldwani-court-rejects-police-plea-in-28-voter-deletion-case-40433
 301.html More: https://offtheroll.in/india/disputes/#d-court-69
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/disputes/
